{% comment %}
  Renders one "pick N from collection X" group inside an offer page.

  Accepts:
  - group_index {Number} zero-based index, used for ids and JS grouping
  - group_heading {String} e.g. "Choose 2 items from Modern Collection"
  - group_products {Array<Product>} hand-picked products for this group. Highest
    priority: when set, the collections below are ignored entirely.
  - group_collection {Collection} the eligible products (single-collection mode)
  - group_collections {String} comma-separated collection handles to merge into
    one picker, e.g. "men, women, unisex" (multi-collection mode; products are
    deduped across collections). Wins over group_collection when both set.

  Source priority: group_products > group_collections > group_collection.
  - group_pick_count {Number} how many items must be picked from this group
    (exact mode — the customer must pick precisely this many)
  - group_min {Number} / group_max {Number} quantity mode instead of an exact
    count: the customer picks any quantity between the two. Used by the duo
    page ("1–5 perfumes AND 1–5 attars"), where the price follows the
    quantities rather than a fixed pick count. When only group_pick_count is
    given, min and max are both set to it, i.e. the original exact behaviour.
  - group_include {String} which products may appear: 'bottles' (default —
    perfume bottles only, roll-ons filtered out), 'rollons' (attar roll-ons
    only), or 'all'. See the roll-on note further down for why this is checked
    against collection membership rather than trusting the chosen collection.
  - group_noun {String} what one item in this group is called, e.g. 'perfume'
    or 'attar'. Used for the sticky bar's "Add 1 more attar" prompt.
  - group_open {Boolean} whether the accordion starts expanded
  - group_id {String} DOM id for this group. Set in the section's choice
    (tabs) mode so a tab button can point at it with aria-controls; blank
    otherwise, which leaves the markup exactly as it was before tabs existed.
  - group_labelled_by {String} id of the tab button that opens this group.
    Set together with group_id — it's what makes the group a tabpanel.
  - group_hidden {Boolean} choice mode only: this group belongs to a tab that
    isn't the open one, so it renders hidden. offer-builder.js flips it.
  - offer_product {Product} the offer product itself (excluded from the grid)
  - block_attributes {String} block.shopify_attributes, when rendered from a block

  Usage:
  {% render 'offer-group',
     group_index: 0,
     group_heading: 'Choose 2 items',
     group_collection: collections['modern'],
     group_pick_count: 2,
     group_open: true,
     offer_product: product %}
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  if group_products != blank and group_products.size > 0
    # hand-picked in the theme editor — exactly these products, in this order
    assign grid_products = group_products
    assign group_products_count = group_products.size
    assign title_list = blank
  elsif group_collections != blank
    assign handles_list = group_collections | split: ','
    assign first_handle = handles_list | first | strip

    comment
      `| reverse | reverse` is NOT a no-op here — don't "simplify" it away.
      `collection.products` is a paginated drop, not an Array, and Liquid's
      `concat` rejects a non-Array *argument*: the assign below silently fails
      and every collection after the first is dropped from the picker. Symptom
      (found 2026-09-05): offer-2/3/5 merge "men-3, women-1, unisex-3" but
      rendered only men-3's five perfumes — Florence Orchidia, which is only in
      women-1, never appeared on any offer page, and "Offer for 5" therefore
      demanded all five of the only five products it showed. `reverse` forces
      the drop to a real Array; applying it twice keeps each collection's own
      order intact.
    endcomment
    assign merged_products = collections[first_handle].products | reverse | reverse
    assign title_list = collections[first_handle].title
    for h in handles_list offset: 1
      assign h_clean = h | strip
      assign col = collections[h_clean]
      if col != blank
        assign col_products = col.products | reverse | reverse
        assign merged_products = merged_products | concat: col_products
        assign title_list = title_list | append: ', ' | append: col.title
      endif
    endfor
    assign group_products_count = merged_products.size
    assign grid_products = merged_products
  else
    assign grid_products = group_collection.products
    assign group_products_count = group_collection.products_count
    assign title_list = group_collection.title
  endif

  comment
    Exact mode (min == max) is the original "pick exactly N" behaviour and stays
    the default, so every existing offer page is unaffected. Quantity mode
    (min != max) is what the duo page uses.
  endcomment
  assign pick_max = group_max | plus: 0
  assign pick_min = group_min | plus: 0
  if pick_max <= 0
    assign pick_max = group_pick_count | plus: 0
  endif
  if pick_min <= 0
    assign pick_min = pick_max
  endif
  if pick_max < pick_min
    assign pick_max = pick_min
  endif

  assign is_range = false
  if pick_min != pick_max
    assign is_range = true
  endif

  assign include_mode = group_include | default: 'bottles'

  # 10ML/35ML variants on signature-series products exist only to back the
  # free-gift picker, never a normal purchase option — hidden from this
  # bundle page's own size dropdown the same way
  # snippets/product-variant-options.liquid hides them on the main product
  # page. Scoped to the qualifying collection so roll-ons (which have their
  # own legitimate, purchasable 10ML/35ML sizes) are unaffected.
  assign gift_qualifying_collection = settings.free_gift_qualifying_collection
  if gift_qualifying_collection == blank
    assign gift_qualifying_collection = collections['signature-series']
  endif

  assign heading = group_heading
  if heading == blank
    if is_range
      assign heading = 'Choose ' | append: pick_min | append: '–' | append: pick_max | append: ' items'
    else
      assign heading = 'Choose ' | append: pick_max | append: ' items'
    endif
    if title_list != blank
      assign heading = heading | append: ' from ' | append: title_list
    endif
  endif

  assign seen_ids = ''
-%}

<div
  class="offer-group"
  {% if group_id != blank %}id="{{ group_id }}"{% endif %}
  data-offer-group
  data-group-index="{{ group_index }}"
  data-group-pick-count="{{ pick_max }}"
  data-group-min="{{ pick_min }}"
  data-group-max="{{ pick_max }}"
  {% if is_range %}data-group-range="true"{% endif %}
  {% if group_noun != blank %}data-group-noun="{{ group_noun | escape }}"{% endif %}
  data-group-name="{{ heading | escape }}"
  {% if group_labelled_by != blank %}role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="{{ group_labelled_by }}"{% endif %}
  {% if group_hidden %}hidden{% endif %}
  {{ block_attributes }}
>
  <details class="offer-group__details" {% if group_open %}open{% endif %}>
    <summary class="offer-group__summary">
      <span class="offer-group__summary-main">
        <span class="offer-group__summary-text">{{ heading }}</span>
      </span>
      <span class="offer-group__summary-meta">
        <span class="offer-group__pill" data-group-counter>
          {%- if is_range -%}Min {{ pick_min }}{%- else -%}0 / {{ pick_max }}{%- endif -%}
        </span>
        <span class="offer-group__toggle" aria-hidden="true">
          {% render 'icon-caret' %}
        </span>
      </span>
    </summary>

    <div class="offer-group__content">
      {%- if group_products_count == 0 -%}
        <p class="offer-group__empty">
          {%- if request.design_mode -%}
            Choose the products for this group in the theme editor — either
            hand-pick them under &ldquo;Products&rdquo; or select a collection.
          {%- else -%}
            These items are being restocked. Please check back soon.
          {%- endif -%}
        </p>
      {%- else -%}
        {%- comment -%}
          Counted inside the loop below and read after it (Liquid keeps
          for-loop assignments in scope), so a group whose source collection
          has products but none of the right kind — an attar group pointed at
          a bottles-only collection — says so instead of rendering a blank row.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- assign rendered_count = 0 -%}
        <div class="offer-grid-wrap">
          <div class="offer-grid__nav" role="group" aria-label="Browse products">
            <button type="button" class="offer-grid__arrow offer-grid__arrow--prev" data-offer-grid-prev aria-label="Scroll left">
              {% render 'icon-arrow' %}
            </button>
            <button type="button" class="offer-grid__arrow offer-grid__arrow--next" data-offer-grid-next aria-label="Scroll right">
              {% render 'icon-arrow' %}
            </button>
          </div>
          <div class="offer-grid" data-offer-grid>
          {%- for item in grid_products -%}
            {%- if forloop.index > 60 -%}
              {%- break -%}
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- assign item_id_str = item.id | append: ',' -%}
            {%- if seen_ids contains item_id_str -%}
              {%- continue -%}
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- assign seen_ids = seen_ids | append: item_id_str -%}
            {%- if item.id == offer_product.id -%}
              {%- continue -%}
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- comment -%}
              Bottle/roll-on membership is checked directly rather than trusting
              whichever collection admin picked: the store has duplicate
              "Men"/"Women"/"Unisex" collections (one roll-on-only, one
              bottle-only) with identical titles, so a group pointed at "Men"
              would otherwise be a coin toss.

              'bottles' is the default because a plain offer picker is perfume
              bottles only. The duo page's attar group passes 'rollons' to get
              the exact opposite set.
            {%- endcomment -%}
            {%- assign is_rollon = false -%}
            {%- for item_collection in item.collections -%}
              {%- if item_collection.handle == 'attar-roll-ons' -%}
                {%- assign is_rollon = true -%}
                {%- break -%}
              {%- endif -%}
            {%- endfor -%}
            {%- if include_mode == 'bottles' and is_rollon -%}
              {%- continue -%}
            {%- elsif include_mode == 'rollons' and is_rollon == false -%}
              {%- continue -%}
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- liquid
              assign is_gift_qualifying = false
              if settings.free_gift_enabled
                for c in item.collections
                  if c.handle == gift_qualifying_collection.handle
                    assign is_gift_qualifying = true
                    break
                  endif
                endfor
              endif

              assign variant = item.selected_or_first_available_variant
              if is_gift_qualifying and variant.option1 == '10ML' or is_gift_qualifying and variant.option1 == '35ML'
                for v in item.variants
                  unless v.option1 == '10ML' or v.option1 == '35ML'
                    assign variant = v
                    break
                  endunless
                endfor
              endif

              assign card_id = 'OfferCard-' | append: group_index | append: '-' | append: forloop.index
              assign item_alt = item.title | escape
              assign rendered_count = rendered_count | plus: 1
            -%}
            <div
              class="offer-card{% unless item.available %} offer-card--soldout{% endunless %}"
              data-offer-card
              data-group-index="{{ group_index }}"
              data-variant-id="{{ variant.id }}"
              data-product-title="{{ item.title | escape }}"
              data-variant-title="{{ variant.title | escape }}"
              data-price="{{ variant.price }}"
              data-available="{{ variant.available }}"
            >
              <div class="offer-card__media">
                {%- if item.featured_image -%}
                  {{
                    item.featured_image
                    | image_url: width: 600
                    | image_tag:
                      loading: 'lazy',
                      widths: '240, 360, 480, 600',
                      sizes: '(min-width: 990px) 22vw, (min-width: 750px) 30vw, 56vw',
                      class: 'offer-card__image',
                      alt: item_alt
                  }}
                {%- else -%}
                  {{ 'product-1' | placeholder_svg_tag: 'placeholder-svg offer-card__image' }}
                {%- endif -%}
                <span class="offer-card__check" aria-hidden="true">{% render 'icon-checkmark' %}</span>
              </div>

              <div class="offer-card__body">
                <h3 class="offer-card__title">{{ item.title | escape }}</h3>

                {%- unless item.has_only_default_variant -%}
                  <div class="offer-card__variant-row">
                    <label class="offer-card__variant-label" for="{{ card_id }}-variant">
                      {{- item.options.first -}}:
                    </label>
                    <div class="select offer-card__variant-select">
                      <select class="offer-card__variant select__select" id="{{ card_id }}-variant" data-offer-variant>
                        {%- for v in item.variants -%}
                          {%- if is_gift_qualifying and v.option1 == '10ML' or is_gift_qualifying and v.option1 == '35ML' -%}
                            {%- continue -%}
                          {%- endif -%}
                          <option
                            value="{{ v.id }}"
                            data-price="{{ v.price }}"
                            data-price-formatted="{{ v.price | money_without_trailing_zeros | replace: 'Rs.', '₹' | replace: '₹ ', '₹' }}"
                            data-variant-title="{{ v.title | escape }}"
                            data-option1="{{ v.option1 | escape }}"
                            data-available="{{ v.available }}"
                            {% if v.id == variant.id %}
                              selected
                            {% endif %}
                            {% unless v.available %}
                              disabled
                            {% endunless %}
                          >
                            {{- v.title -}}
                          </option>
                        {%- endfor -%}
                      </select>
                      {% render 'icon-caret' %}
                    </div>
                  </div>
                {%- endunless -%}

                <div class="offer-card__price" data-offer-price>{{ variant.price | money_without_trailing_zeros | replace: 'Rs.', '₹' | replace: '₹ ', '₹' }}</div>

                <button
                  type="button"
                  class="offer-card__add"
                  data-offer-card-add
                  {% unless item.available %}
                    disabled
                  {% endunless %}
                >
                  {%- if item.available -%}
                    {{ add_label | default: 'Add to bundle' }}
                  {%- else -%}
                    {{ soldout_label | default: 'Sold out' }}
                  {%- endif -%}
                </button>

                <div class="offer-card__qty" data-offer-card-qty hidden>
                  <button type="button" class="offer-card__qty-btn" data-offer-qty-minus aria-label="Decrease quantity">
                    {% render 'icon-minus' %}
                  </button>
                  <span class="offer-card__qty-value" data-offer-qty-value>1</span>
                  <button type="button" class="offer-card__qty-btn" data-offer-qty-plus aria-label="Increase quantity">
                    {% render 'icon-plus' %}
                  </button>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          {%- endfor -%}
          </div>
        </div>

        {%- if rendered_count == 0 -%}
          <p class="offer-group__empty">
            {%- if request.design_mode -%}
              {%- case include_mode -%}
                {%- when 'rollons' -%}
                  None of this group&rsquo;s products are attar roll-ons. This
                  group is set to show roll-ons only, so point it at a
                  collection whose products are in &ldquo;attar-roll-ons&rdquo;.
                {%- when 'bottles' -%}
                  Every product in this group is an attar roll-on, and this
                  group is set to show perfume bottles only. Point it at a
                  bottles collection, or switch it to &ldquo;Attar roll-ons&rdquo;.
                {%- else -%}
                  No products to show in this group yet.
              {%- endcase -%}
            {%- else -%}
              These items are being restocked. Please check back soon.
            {%- endif -%}
          </p>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </details>
</div>
